    "HTTP 会在当前网络中以明文传输用户名、密码和会话信息。仅在可信的本地网络中继续；如果路由器支持 HTTPS，建议改用 HTTPS 地址。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTP 会在当前网络中以明文传输用户名、密码和会话信息。仅在可信的本地网络中继续；如果路由器支持 HTTPS，建议改用 HTTPS 地址。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTP sends usernames, passwords, and session data in clear text over the current network. Continue only on a trusted local network; if the router supports HTTPS, prefer an HTTPS address."
          }
        }
      }
    },
