    "“%@”及其本机凭据会从此设备移除。不会修改路由器设置。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@”及其本机凭据会从此设备移除。不会修改路由器设置。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” and its on-device credentials will be removed from this device. Router settings will not be changed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "、": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "、"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": ", "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」是核心服务，不提供「%@」操作：执行后可能同时失去手机与电脑的管理通道，只能到路由器跟前恢复。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」是核心服务，不提供「%@」操作：执行后可能同时失去手机与电脑的管理通道，只能到路由器跟前恢复。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ is a core service; the “%@” action is not offered: running it could cut off both phone and computer management access, recoverable only at the router itself."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」是核心服务，重启期间相关功能会短暂中断，服务随后会自动恢复。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」是核心服务，重启期间相关功能会短暂中断，服务随后会自动恢复。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ is a core service: related features pause briefly during the restart, and the service recovers automatically afterwards."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」的修改已下发但结果未确认。验证连接正常后保留修改，或立即回滚。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」的修改已下发但结果未确认。验证连接正常后保留修改，或立即回滚。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Changes to “%@” were sent but the result is unconfirmed. Once the connection verifies, keep the changes or roll back now."
          }
        }
      }
    },
