    "下面是路由器在本次连接中出示的 SSH 主机指纹。请与路由器本地显示或以往记录的指纹核对一致后再信任。信任后，下次连接将自动校验；指纹一旦变化，连接会被阻断并提醒你。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下面是路由器在本次连接中出示的 SSH 主机指纹。请与路由器本地显示或以往记录的指纹核对一致后再信任。信任后，下次连接将自动校验；指纹一旦变化，连接会被阻断并提醒你。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is the SSH host fingerprint the router presented for this connection. Compare it with the fingerprint shown locally on the router or in your records before trusting it. Once trusted, later connections are verified automatically; if the fingerprint ever changes, the connection is blocked and you are told."
          }
        }
      }
    },
