    "优先使用 HTTPS。自签名证书须通过可信渠道核对指纹后再信任；证书变更时应重新核对。HTTP 会明文传输登录信息和会话。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "优先使用 HTTPS。自签名证书须通过可信渠道核对指纹后再信任；证书变更时应重新核对。HTTP 会明文传输登录信息和会话。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prefer HTTPS. Self-signed certificates must be trusted only after verifying the fingerprint through a trusted channel, and re-verified when the certificate changes. HTTP sends login and session data in clear text."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会话": {
