    "全家网络将中断约 2–5 分钟，所有设备的连接都会断开。发送后 App 会自动等待路由器恢复并重新读取状态。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "全家网络将中断约 2–5 分钟，所有设备的连接都会断开。发送后 App 会自动等待路由器恢复并重新读取状态。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The whole home network will be down for about 2–5 minutes and every device will disconnect. After sending, the app waits for the router to recover and re-reads its state."
          }
        }
      }
    },
