    "列表由 DHCP 租约、邻居表与无线关联三处数据合并，同一设备按 MAC 去重；没有 MAC 的邻居条目单独列出。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "列表由 DHCP 租约、邻居表与无线关联三处数据合并，同一设备按 MAC 去重；没有 MAC 的邻居条目单独列出。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This list merges DHCP leases, the neighbor table and wireless association; the same device is deduplicated by MAC, and neighbor entries without a MAC are listed separately."
          }
        }
      }
    },
