    "前台打开 App 时每 30 秒评估一次。App 在后台时由 iOS 决定何时唤醒采样（BGAppRefreshTask），可能间隔数小时，也可能不发生——离线告警以后台尽力而为为准，不能替代路由器自身的可用性保障。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "前台打开 App 时每 30 秒评估一次。App 在后台时由 iOS 决定何时唤醒采样（BGAppRefreshTask），可能间隔数小时，也可能不发生——离线告警以后台尽力而为为准，不能替代路由器自身的可用性保障。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In the foreground the app evaluates every 30 seconds. In the background, iOS decides when sampling wakes (BGAppRefreshTask); it may be hours apart or not happen at all. Treat offline alerts as best-effort — they are not a substitute for the router’s own availability safeguards."
          }
        }
      }
    },
