    "原生连接、状态读取、已安装插件目录、UCI 字段管理、系统服务控制与系统记录。页面内容和可执行操作取决于路由器实际接口、已安装软件包及账户权限。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原生连接、状态读取、已安装插件目录、UCI 字段管理、系统服务控制与系统记录。页面内容和可执行操作取决于路由器实际接口、已安装软件包及账户权限。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Native connection, state reading, installed plugin catalog, UCI field management, system service control, and system records. Page contents and available actions depend on the router’s actual interfaces, installed packages, and account permissions."
          }
        }
      }
    },
