    "备份是 OpenWrt 官方 sysupgrade 格式（含全部配置），与 LuCI 的备份互通。备份文件包含路由器完整配置，只保存在本机；请像对待密码一样保管导出的文件。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "备份是 OpenWrt 官方 sysupgrade 格式（含全部配置），与 LuCI 的备份互通。备份文件包含路由器完整配置，只保存在本机；请像对待密码一样保管导出的文件。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Backups use OpenWrt's official sysupgrade format (the full configuration) and are interchangeable with LuCI's. A backup file contains the router's complete configuration and is stored only on this device; treat exported files like passwords."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "备份独有": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
