    "恢复会覆盖路由器当前配置并重启。开始前 App 会先在路由器上自动备份当前配置，万一恢复有问题，可用那份快照再恢复回来。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "恢复会覆盖路由器当前配置并重启。开始前 App 会先在路由器上自动备份当前配置，万一恢复有问题，可用那份快照再恢复回来。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Restoring overwrites the router's current configuration and reboots it. Before it starts, the app automatically backs up the current configuration on the router, so a bad restore can be undone with that snapshot."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "恢复前的当前配置已备份在路由器：%@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "恢复前的当前配置已备份在路由器：%@"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The pre-restore configuration was backed up on the router: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "恢复后未重新连接": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "恢复后未重新连接"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not Reconnected After Restore"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "恢复后，备份包含的配置以备份为准；当前独有的配置可能被移除或保留，取决于路由器恢复机制对未包含文件的处理。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "恢复后，备份包含的配置以备份为准；当前独有的配置可能被移除或保留，取决于路由器恢复机制对未包含文件的处理。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After the restore, configurations in the backup win. Configurations that exist only in the current setup may be removed or kept, depending on how the router's restore handles files the backup does not include."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "恢复备份": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "恢复备份"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Restore Backup"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "恢复完成，路由器已重新连接。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "恢复完成，路由器已重新连接。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Restore complete; the router has reconnected."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "恢复已执行，但等待超时后路由器仍未恢复连接。请检查电源与网络后手动刷新。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "恢复已执行，但等待超时后路由器仍未恢复连接。请检查电源与网络后手动刷新。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The restore ran, but the router did not come back before the wait timed out. Check its power and network, then refresh manually."
          }
        }
      }
    },
