          }
        }
      }
    },
    "操作记录是给人看的账：做了什么、结果如何。诊断日志是排障原料：连接与内部事件的原始记录，可导出发给支持人员。两者互相独立，不合并。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "操作记录是给人看的账：做了什么、结果如何。诊断日志是排障原料：连接与内部事件的原始记录，可导出发给支持人员。两者互相独立，不合并。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The operation record is the human-readable account: what was done and how it turned out. The diagnostic log is troubleshooting raw material: the original record of connections and internal events, exportable for support. The two are independent and never merged."
          }
        }
      }
