    "无法登录时，请检查 rpcd、uhttpd-mod-ubus 和账户 ACL。各页的数据接口不同，读取失败时会显示路由器返回的错误及重新读取入口。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法登录时，请检查 rpcd、uhttpd-mod-ubus 和账户 ACL。各页的数据接口不同，读取失败时会显示路由器返回的错误及重新读取入口。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If you cannot sign in, check rpcd, uhttpd-mod-ubus, and the account ACLs. Each page uses a different data interface; when a read fails, the error returned by the router and a retry entry are shown."
          }
        }
      }
