    "检出只说明路由器装有对应组件，不代表 App 能执行测速。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检出只说明路由器装有对应组件，不代表 App 能执行测速。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Detection only shows that the router has the component installed; it does not mean the app can run a speed test."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "检查 .1 / .254 等少数地址，逐个验证是否为 OpenWrt，不做全网段扫描": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
