    "滑动可开关普通服务的开机自启，操作前会再次确认。核心服务（如 rpcd、network、dnsmasq）的关闭自启已禁用：关掉它们可能让你同时失去手机与电脑的管理通道。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "滑动可开关普通服务的开机自启，操作前会再次确认。核心服务（如 rpcd、network、dnsmasq）的关闭自启已禁用：关掉它们可能让你同时失去手机与电脑的管理通道。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Swipe to toggle autostart for regular services; each change asks for confirmation first. Disabling autostart is blocked for core services (such as rpcd, network and dnsmasq): turning them off could cost you both phone and computer management access at once."
          }
        }
      }
    },
