    "订阅、流量统计、规则集与节点诊断由 Open-Box 面板在登录后提供，其接口返回结构尚未验证，本页暂不展示，也不会保存你的面板密码。节点切换已在上方代理组中提供。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "订阅、流量统计、规则集与节点诊断由 Open-Box 面板在登录后提供，其接口返回结构尚未验证，本页暂不展示，也不会保存你的面板密码。节点切换已在上方代理组中提供。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Subscriptions, traffic statistics, rule sets and node diagnostics are provided by the Open-Box panel after login; their response shapes are not yet verified, so this page does not show them yet and never stores your panel password. Node switching is available in the proxy groups above."
          }
        }
      }
