    "路由器名称、地址、用户名、上次连接时间及显示偏好保存在本机 App 存储中。设备的备份由 iOS 系统设置管理。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "路由器名称、地址、用户名、上次连接时间及显示偏好保存在本机 App 存储中。设备的备份由 iOS 系统设置管理。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Router names, addresses, usernames, last-connected times, and display preferences are stored in this app’s on-device storage. Device backups are managed by iOS Settings."
          }
