        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The router recovered and its state was re-read."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "路由器已接受回滚请求，请核对重新读取的配置。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "路由器已接受回滚请求，请核对重新读取的配置。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The router accepted the rollback request. Check the re-read configuration."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "路由器当前配置将被这份备份覆盖，全家网络会中断数分钟。恢复前会自动备份当前配置到路由器 /tmp 目录。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "路由器当前配置将被这份备份覆盖，全家网络会中断数分钟。恢复前会自动备份当前配置到路由器 /tmp 目录。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The router's current configuration will be overwritten by this backup and the household network will be down for a few minutes. The current configuration is backed up to the router's /tmp directory first."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "路由器拒绝了 SSH 连接：SSH 服务可能未开启，或端口不是 22。请在路由器上确认 dropbear 的运行状态。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
