            "state": "translated",
            "value": "路由器拒绝了 SSH 连接：SSH 服务可能未开启，或端口不是 22。请在路由器上确认 dropbear 的运行状态。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The router refused the SSH connection: the SSH service may be off, or the port is not 22. Check that dropbear is running on the router."
