        }
      }
    },
    "这份备份由外部导入，没有配置清单可预览。恢复将按文件内容整体覆盖，请只恢复你信任来源的备份。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这份备份由外部导入，没有配置清单可预览。恢复将按文件内容整体覆盖，请只恢复你信任来源的备份。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This backup was imported from elsewhere and has no configuration inventory to preview. Restoring applies the file as a whole; only restore backups from sources you trust."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这台路由器出示的 SSH 指纹与已信任的记录不一致。可能原因：路由器重装或刷机后生成了新密钥，或连接被中间人劫持。请先通过可信方式核对新指纹，确认无误后再重新信任。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台路由器出示的 SSH 指纹与已信任的记录不一致。可能原因：路由器重装或刷机后生成了新密钥，或连接被中间人劫持。请先通过可信方式核对新指纹，确认无误后再重新信任。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The SSH fingerprint this router presented does not match the trusted record. Possible causes: the router was reinstalled or reflashed and generated a new key, or the connection is being intercepted. Verify the new fingerprint through a trusted channel before re-trusting it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这台路由器未发现对应功能，或发现尚未完成。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台路由器未发现对应功能，或发现尚未完成。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This feature was not discovered on this router, or discovery has not finished."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这台路由器未检测到可用的软件包管理器（opkg 或 apk），App 无法为它检查更新。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台路由器未检测到可用的软件包管理器（opkg 或 apk），App 无法为它检查更新。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No usable package manager (opkg or apk) was detected on this router, so the app cannot check it for updates."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这台路由器没有独立的 WAN 口，上游接口就是局域网接口（%@）。重启它会让经这台路由器上网的设备短暂断网（通常 10–60 秒），你与这台路由器的连接也会短暂中断。完成后 App 会核对接口是否恢复。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台路由器没有独立的 WAN 口，上游接口就是局域网接口（%@）。重启它会让经这台路由器上网的设备短暂断网（通常 10–60 秒），你与这台路由器的连接也会短暂中断。完成后 App 会核对接口是否恢复。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This router has no separate WAN port: the upstream interface is the LAN interface (%@). Restarting it briefly cuts internet access for devices routed through this router (usually 10–60 seconds), and your connection to this router drops briefly too. The app verifies the interface afterwards."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这条记录来自邻居表且没有 MAC 地址，无法与租约或无线关联合并，也无法命名或拉黑。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这条记录来自邻居表且没有 MAC 地址，无法与租约或无线关联合并，也无法命名或拉黑。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This entry comes from the neighbor table without a MAC address, so it cannot be merged with leases or associations, named, or blocked."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这里只显示路由器配置中加入的网络。节点的实时在线状态要靠路由器上的 ZeroTier 工具输出，路由器没有向 App 开放这条通道，所以这里不显示在线状态。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这里只显示路由器配置中加入的网络。节点的实时在线状态要靠路由器上的 ZeroTier 工具输出，路由器没有向 App 开放这条通道，所以这里不显示在线状态。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This page only shows the networks recorded in the router configuration. Live node status comes from the ZeroTier tool on the router, and the router does not expose that channel to the app, so online status is not shown here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
