    "卸载后依赖它的功能会立即失效；若其他软件包依赖它，路由器会拒绝并说明。完成后回读验证。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "卸载后依赖它的功能会立即失效；若其他软件包依赖它，路由器会拒绝并说明。完成后回读验证。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Features depending on it stop working immediately; if other packages depend on it, the router refuses and explains. The result is verified by read-back."
