          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Install package"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "密码不足 8 位，偏弱：建议用更长、只用于这台路由器的密码。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "密码不足 8 位，偏弱：建议用更长、只用于这台路由器的密码。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Under 8 characters — weak. Prefer a longer password used only for this router."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "密码会立即在路由器上生效：其他设备与浏览器要用新密码重新登录。本机已保存的这台路由器密码会同步更新，不会把你锁在门外。当前连接不会中断。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "密码会立即在路由器上生效：其他设备与浏览器要用新密码重新登录。本机已保存的这台路由器密码会同步更新，不会把你锁在门外。当前连接不会中断。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The password takes effect on the router immediately: other devices and browsers must sign in again with the new one. The password saved on this device is updated in step, so you are not locked out. The current connection stays up."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "密码已修改，并已用新密码验证登录成功；本机凭据已同步更新。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "密码已修改，并已用新密码验证登录成功；本机凭据已同步更新。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Password changed and verified by signing in with it; the credentials saved on this device are updated."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "密码已在路由器上生效，但更新本机钥匙串失败：下次连接时请手动输入新密码。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "密码已在路由器上生效，但更新本机钥匙串失败：下次连接时请手动输入新密码。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The password is live on the router, but updating this device's Keychain failed: type the new password manually at the next connection."
          }
        }
      }
    },
