          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installed through the router's own package-manager channel, dependencies included. The installed list is read back afterwards to verify."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "走路由器自己的正规改密通道（与电脑版管理页相同）。改完会先用新密码试登录一次，确认生效才更新本机保存的密码。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "走路由器自己的正规改密通道（与电脑版管理页相同）。改完会先用新密码试登录一次，确认生效才更新本机保存的密码。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uses the router's own password-change channel (the same as the web admin page). Afterwards the new password is proven with a test sign-in before the saved password on this device is updated."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "路由器已接受改密请求，但用新密码试登录没有通过。本机保存的密码未更新——请断开后用新密码重新连接核对；若新密码也不行，再用旧密码试一次。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "路由器已接受改密请求，但用新密码试登录没有通过。本机保存的密码未更新——请断开后用新密码重新连接核对；若新密码也不行，再用旧密码试一次。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The router accepted the change, but signing in with the new password did not succeed. The password saved on this device was NOT updated — disconnect and reconnect with the new password to check; if that fails too, try the old password."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "路由器已接受改密，但新密码试登录未通过，本机凭据未更新。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
