          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switch to This Router"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "身份验证未完成，请手动输入密码。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "身份验证未完成，请手动输入密码。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Authentication wasn't completed. Please enter the password manually."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "使用 Face ID 解锁 App": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 Face ID 解锁 App"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unlock the App with Face ID"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开启后，冷启动或离开超过 30 秒再返回时，需要用 Face ID、触控 ID 或设备密码解锁；锁定期间不显示任何路由器内容。切换路由器时调用保存密码前的 Face ID 验证始终生效，不受此开关影响。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启后，冷启动或离开超过 30 秒再返回时，需要用 Face ID、触控 ID 或设备密码解锁；锁定期间不显示任何路由器内容。切换路由器时调用保存密码前的 Face ID 验证始终生效，不受此开关影响。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, returning after a cold start or more than 30 seconds away requires Face ID, Touch ID, or your device passcode to unlock; no router content is shown while locked. The Face ID check before a saved password is used to switch routers is always on and is not affected by this switch."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "身份验证未完成，未使用保存的密码。请输入 SSH 密码后重试。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "身份验证未完成，未使用保存的密码。请输入 SSH 密码后重试。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Authentication wasn't completed, so the saved password was not used. Enter the SSH password and try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "未安装流量监控组件": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未安装流量监控组件"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Traffic monitoring component not installed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这台路由器没有安装 nlbwmon 流量监控组件（或未向 App 会话开放其数据通道），暂时无法显示流量排行。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台路由器没有安装 nlbwmon 流量监控组件（或未向 App 会话开放其数据通道），暂时无法显示流量排行。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This router has no nlbwmon traffic monitoring component installed (or does not expose its data channel to app sessions), so the traffic ranking cannot be shown yet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "以下配置未获路由器授权读取：%@。这台固件没有向 App 登录会话开放它们（rpcd ACL 未包含），需要在路由器上补授权后才能查看。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以下配置未获路由器授权读取：%@。这台固件没有向 App 登录会话开放它们（rpcd ACL 未包含），需要在路由器上补授权后才能查看。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The router has not authorized reading these configurations: %@. This firmware does not expose them to app login sessions (not covered by the rpcd ACL); they can be viewed after adding the grant on the router."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这台固件未向 App 登录会话开放新建文件夹、重命名、删除空目录与向任意路径写入（rpcd 未授权），相关操作已禁用；需要在路由器上补授权后才能使用。浏览与已授权文件的读取不受影响。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台固件未向 App 登录会话开放新建文件夹、重命名、删除空目录与向任意路径写入（rpcd 未授权），相关操作已禁用；需要在路由器上补授权后才能使用。浏览与已授权文件的读取不受影响。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This firmware does not expose creating folders, renaming, removing empty directories, or writing to arbitrary paths to app login sessions (not authorized by rpcd), so those actions are disabled; they become available after adding the grant on the router. Browsing and reading authorized files are unaffected."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这台固件未向 App 会话开放此路径的写入（rpcd 未授权），只能查看，不能保存修改。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台固件未向 App 会话开放此路径的写入（rpcd 未授权），只能查看，不能保存修改。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This firmware does not expose writing to this path to app sessions (not authorized by rpcd); the file can be viewed but changes cannot be saved."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "路由器未授权读取此文件：这台固件没有向 App 会话开放该路径的读取（rpcd ACL 未包含），需要在路由器上补授权后才能打开。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "路由器未授权读取此文件：这台固件没有向 App 会话开放该路径的读取（rpcd ACL 未包含），需要在路由器上补授权后才能打开。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The router has not authorized reading this file: this firmware does not expose reading this path to app sessions (not covered by the rpcd ACL); it can be opened after adding the grant on the router."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "路由器当前配置将被这份备份覆盖，全家网络会中断数分钟。恢复前会自动把当前配置另存一份到本机备份库，恢复不满意可以再恢复回来。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "路由器当前配置将被这份备份覆盖，全家网络会中断数分钟。恢复前会自动把当前配置另存一份到本机备份库，恢复不满意可以再恢复回来。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The router's current configuration will be overwritten by this backup and the household network will be down for a few minutes. The current configuration is first saved to the on-device backup library, so it can be restored again if the result is not satisfactory."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "恢复前的当前配置已另存到本机备份库：%@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "恢复前的当前配置已另存到本机备份库：%@"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The pre-restore configuration was saved to the on-device backup library: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "备份已保存至 %@；此固件不提供路由器端哈希回读，传输完整性已由分块写入的尺寸校验确认，镜像合法性校验通过。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "备份已保存至 %@；此固件不提供路由器端哈希回读，传输完整性已由分块写入的尺寸校验确认，镜像合法性校验通过。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Backup saved to %@; this firmware offers no router-side hash readback, so transfer integrity was confirmed by the chunked write's size verification, and the image passed the legality check."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
